#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><h2>
#: template.html:62
msgid "What’s New in This Update"
msgstr "本アップデートでの変更点"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><h3>
#: template.html:64
msgid "For Players"
msgstr "プレイヤー向け"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><a>
#: template.html:65
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "<a href=\"images/start-4.jpg\">"
msgid "<a href=\"images/start-2.jpg\">"
msgstr "<a href=\"images/start-4.jpg\">"

#. type: Attribute 'alt' of: <html><body><div><div><div><a><img>
#: template.html:65
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Campaigns menu screenshot"
msgid "Celes theme screenshot"
msgstr "キャンペーンメニューのスクリーンショット"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div>
#: template.html:65 template.html:72 template.html:80 template.html:88
#: template.html:106
msgid "</a>"
msgstr "</a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:67
msgid ""
"Wesnoth once again has an Android port, currently available on the <a "
"href=\"https://f-droid.org/en/packages/org.wesnoth.Wesnoth/\">F-Droid store</"
"a>, representing both a lot of work and the first time in many years that a "
"modern version of Wesnoth is available outside of the usual Windows, macOS, "
"and Linux systems."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:69
msgid ""
"Performance has also been further improved, with graphical lag and "
"stuttering significantly reduced especially on lower end systems."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:71
msgid ""
"Additionally, with this release the new Celes UI theme has been added along "
"with a major overhaul of the main menu to give Wesnoth a more interesting "
"and modern look."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><a>
#: template.html:72
msgid "<a href=\"images/start-1.png\">"
msgstr "<a href=\"images/start-1.png\">"

#. type: Attribute 'alt' of: <html><body><div><div><div><a><img>
#: template.html:72
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Campaigns menu screenshot"
msgid "Main menu screenshot"
msgstr "キャンペーンメニューのスクリーンショット"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><h4>
#: template.html:74
msgid "Campaigns"
msgstr "キャンペーン"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:76
msgid ""
"<cite>Heir to the Throne</cite> now features an open world with 33 branching "
"scenarios, each awarding Konrad unique recruits, companions, or items. The "
"original campaign is still available as Heir to the Throne, Classic."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:78
msgid ""
"<cite>The Deceiver’s Gambit</cite> replaces Delfador’s Memoirs. Follow a "
"young mage from the shores of Alduin to the halls of the King as they war "
"against the fierce orcs of the north. Choose between 23 magic spells as you "
"bear witness to the rise of a tyrant."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><a>
#: template.html:80
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "<a href=\"images/start-3.png\">"
msgid "<a href=\"images/start-3.webp\">"
msgstr "<a href=\"images/start-3.png\">"

#. type: Attribute 'alt' of: <html><body><div><div><div><a><img>
#: template.html:80
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Campaigns menu screenshot"
msgid "Campaigns screenshot 1"
msgstr "キャンペーンメニューのスクリーンショット"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:82
msgid ""
"<cite>Dusk of Dawn</cite> is our first troll campaign. Lead the Golden Flame "
"Tribe out from the bowels of Irdya and up to the surface world — but beware "
"what awaits you there."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:84
msgid ""
"<cite>Of Pearls and Pirates</cite> is a new beginner-oriented campaign set "
"in a sleepy fishing town on the Bay of Pearls. When corsairs strike, the "
"villagers must join forces with the local merfolk and take the fight to the "
"pirates."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:86
msgid ""
"<cite>The South Guard</cite> has been significantly revised, and now "
"replaces the classic Battle Training tutorial. For players nostalgic for "
"Delfador's tutelage, the original tutorial is still available as part of "
"Heir to the Throne, Classic."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><a>
#: template.html:88
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "<a href=\"images/start-4.jpg\">"
msgid "<a href=\"images/start-4.webp\">"
msgstr "<a href=\"images/start-4.jpg\">"

#. type: Attribute 'alt' of: <html><body><div><div><div><a><img>
#: template.html:88
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Campaigns menu screenshot"
msgid "Campaign screenshot 2"
msgstr "キャンペーンメニューのスクリーンショット"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:90
msgid ""
"<cite>The Hammer of Thursagan</cite> has been enhanced with story "
"adjustments, improved enemy AI, a new Thunderer advancement, a redesign of "
"High Pass, and the re-addition of the formerly removed Mages and Drakes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:92
msgid ""
"<cite>Winds of Fate</cite> has been rebalanced with much lower recall costs, "
"redesigned wildlife spawners and AI, and a much larger mid-campaign battle. "
"Several characters and dialogue sequences were changed for better continuity "
"with other campaigns."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><h4>
#: template.html:94
msgid "Multiplayer"
msgstr "マルチプレイヤー"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:96
msgid ""
"Online multiplayer also had just as many changes with the addition of an <a "
"href=\"https://tournament.wesnoth.org/\">official tournaments and ranked "
"mode website</a> where players can compete in individual tournaments, for "
"elo in the ranking system, send out challenges to individual players, and "
"much more. In support of this there are now queues in the online lobby that "
"players can join that will automatically start a game once there are enough "
"players as well as a new <cite>Ranked Era</cite> that will be updated more "
"frequently with unit balance changes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:98
msgid ""
"Speaking of, another round of balancing changes have been implemented for "
"the Default era factions, which now includes the Dunefolk. Along with this, "
"several maps have been updated to better account for the Dunefolk as well as "
"address some long standing issues in certain faction matchups. A new map, "
"Double Siege, has also been added."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:100
msgid ""
"All of this will allow us to have tools to easily host various events and "
"tournaments through the span of this version and beyond. This will hopefully "
"let us bring more engagement and players and eras to the scene, recovering a "
"sliver of well deserved glory this game should have!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><h3>
#: template.html:102
msgid "For Content Creators"
msgstr "コンテンツクリエイター向け"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:104
msgid ""
"And last but not least, there have been a variety of improvements for "
"content creators as well with the most obvious being the new unit type "
"editor that's been added to the scenario editor. With this it's possible to "
"create entire new units from within the editor itself."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><div><a>
#: template.html:106
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "<a href=\"images/start-2.png\">"
msgid "<a href=\"images/start-5.png\">"
msgstr "<a href=\"images/start-2.png\">"

#. type: Attribute 'alt' of: <html><body><div><div><div><a><img>
#: template.html:106
msgid "Unit type editor"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:108
msgid ""
"For a more advanced feature, it's also now possible for add-on authors to "
"define their own GUI2 themes and use them within their own content via the "
"lua function <code>gui.switch_theme()</code>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:110
msgid ""
"Many other APIs have been implemented and improved as well including an "
"alignment property for individual weapons, many new features for abilities "
"and weapon specials including a registry of both to make using them much "
"easier, new functionality added to lua widgets to allow for more complex "
"dialogs, and at long last simultaneous movement of units with "
"<code>[move_units_fake]</code>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:112
msgid ""
"The <code>wmllint</code> tool has been updated to address some long standing "
"issues and is also now regularly run against the base game which will help "
"to keep it in a maintained and working state for add-on authors."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><h2>
#: template.html:116
msgid "Contribute"
msgstr "貢献"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:118
msgid ""
"<cite>The Battle for Wesnoth</cite> is constantly being improved and "
"expanded upon by a multitude of international volunteers from diverse "
"backgrounds. Since its inception in July 2003, hundreds of people have "
"contributed to all areas of the game, from mainline content shipped as part "
"of the official releases to hundreds of player-made projects available to "
"download from our add-ons server. Whether you need help beating a particular "
"scenario or adding a feature to your custom maps, <cite>Wesnoth</cite> "
"boasts a massive community of players and creators always willing to help."
msgstr ""
"<cite>The Battle for Wesnoth</cite> は世界各国の様々な得意分野を持つ人々の自"
"発的な貢献によって発展を続けています。2003 年 7 月にプロジェクトが始まって以"
"来、公式リリースに取り込まれたコンテンツはもちろん、アドオンサーバからダウン"
"ロード可能なユーザの独自プロジェクトまで、多くの人々が様々な形でプロジェクト"
"に貢献してきました。シナリオがクリアできないとき、独自マップの作成で困ったと"
"きなど、<cite>Wesnoth</cite>の誇るこの巨大なコミュニティがきっとあなたの助け"
"になってくれるでしょう。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><p>
#: template.html:120
msgid ""
"Besides creating your own add-on content, there are many other ways you can "
"help <cite>Wesnoth</cite>:"
msgstr ""
"アドオンコンテンツの作成以外にも、<cite>Wesnoth</cite> の開発に貢献する方法は"
"たくさんあります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><ul><li>
#: template.html:123
msgid "<a href=\"https://wiki.wesnoth.org/Project\">Contribute</a> code"
msgstr ""
"コードの<a href=\"https://wiki.wesnoth.org/Project\">コントリビューション</a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><ul><li>
#: template.html:124
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://forums.wesnoth.org/viewforum.php?f=9\">Create</a> art for "
"the main game or for user-made <a href=\"https://forums.wesnoth.org/"
"viewforum.php?f=23\">add-ons</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://forums.wesnoth.org/viewforum.php?f=9\">メインゲーム</a>と"
"<a href=\"https://forums.wesnoth.org/viewforum.php?f=23\">アドオン</a>用のグ"
"ラフィック制作"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><ul><li>
#: template.html:125
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://wiki.wesnoth.org/WesnothTranslations\">Translate</a> the "
"game into your language"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://wiki.wesnoth.org/WesnothTranslations\">翻訳</a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><ul><li>
#: template.html:126
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://forums.wesnoth.org/viewforum.php?f=14\">Produce</a> new "
"music tracks and sound effects"
msgstr ""
"ミュージックトラックとサウンドエフェクトの<a href=\"https://forums.wesnoth."
"org/viewforum.php?f=14\">制作</a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><div><ul><li>
#: template.html:127
msgid "Spread the word about <cite>Wesnoth</cite> on social media!"
msgstr "ソーシャルメディア上で<cite>Wesnoth</cite>を広める！"

